# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is flagged as unmaintained, but the package is
# not imported by this module at all (`go mod why golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp`
# reports "main module does not need package"): the module dependency itself
# is only used for ssh/acme/bcrypt, and the advisory has no fixed version.
GO-2026-5932

# braces 3.0.3 (via micromatch and chokidar in docs/) has a stack-overflow DoS
# on deeply nested patterns and no fixed release yet. It only runs on
# build-time globs we control, never on user input.
# Remove once upstream ships a fix: https://github.com/micromatch/braces/issues/70
CVE-2026-93687

# docs/ build tooling only (got via cacheable-request); no fixed release.
CVE-2026-93748

# deepmerge 4.3.1 (docs/ via @svgr/plugin-svgo) has no fixed release.
CVE-2026-93753

# minimatch 3.x/5.x (docs/ via serve-handler and @redocly/openapi-core) is fixed
# only in 11.x, whose API those consumers do not support. Build-time globs only.
CVE-2026-118764
